    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You release a blast of brilliant fire. Make a ranged spell attack against a target within range; the target gains no benefit from Half Cover or Three-Quarters Cover against it. On a hit, the target takes 2d10 Radiant damage.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> You create one additional blast for each spell slot level above 1. You can aim the blasts at one target or at several, making a separate attack roll for each.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-yj5CNihf8ZFWVZE8\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Roll the attack and its damage once per blast.</p></section>",
